Package: Entropy
Type: Package
Title: Entropy Estimation for Seurat Objects
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aryan", "Kamal", email = "aryan.kamal@embl.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Charles", "Dussiau", email = "charles.dussiau@embl.de", role = c("aut")),
    person("Amelia", "Kurti", email = "amelia.kurti@dkfz-heidelberg.de", role = c("aut")),
    person("Judith", "Zaugg", email = "judith.zaugg@embl.de", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Aryan Kamal <aryan.kamal@embl.de>
Description: This package provides methods to estimate transcriptional entropy
    for individual cells in Seurat objects. It supports BUB-based entropy
    estimation using neighborhood gene expression and allows integration
    into standard Seurat workflows.
